## Implementation Details

The Analytics component is properly integrated in `src/App.jsx`:

```javascript
import { Analytics } from '@vercel/analytics/react'

export default function App() {
  return (
    <QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>
      <Dashboard />
      <Analytics />
    </QueryClientProvider>
  )
}
```

This follows the exact pattern recommended in the official Vercel documentation for React applications.

## Next Steps for Production Use

To see analytics data in your Vercel dashboard:
1. Ensure the project is deployed to Vercel
2. Wait for users to visit your site
3. Navigate to the Analytics section in your Vercel project dashboard

